    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχλῠώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hazy, misty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νότοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					3.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				367a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀέρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.3.8
