					D.Chr.
					1.68
				</span></i>
			; <i>dim,</i> of sight, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις -εστέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					16.224
				</span></i>
